/*!
 * \namespace asn1
 *
 * \brief ASN.1 I/O Library namespace
 *
 * Root namespace that contains all the library definitions.
 *
 * \namespace asn1::univ
 *
 * \brief Universal class tag definitions
 *
 * This is, in essence, the constants corresponding to the first 36 tag numbers (15 is reserved) of
 * the known types when the tag class is universal.
 *
 * It includes the operation that determines whether a tag is the \em EOC, as this depends on the
 * corresponding tag number constant.
 */
